name    cam
prog    cam
# `cam' is a CAMSHAFT lift-curve calculator, not the Tektronix camera demo
# DOC/INDEX called it until 2026-08-29.  It asks for the rocker ratio, the
# lift at a crank angle and the base circle, then plots the intake lobe in
# Tektronix vectors -- which a vt100 shows as characters.  The dialogue is
# the part worth reading, so answer it rather than watching it draw.  It asks
# for the lift at every 20 crank degrees from -180, so a real run is a long
# series of measurements; three answers is enough to show it is listening.
rate    0.4
wait    6
snap    opening
keys    1.5
key     \r
wait    3
keys    0.4
key     \r
wait    3
keys    1.2
key     \r
wait    4
snap    answered
expect  Lift @ -140 crank degrees
